{"id":894,"slug":"894-implement-eventemitter-class-don-gian","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Coding Challenge","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Implement EventEmitter class đơn giản?","question_en":"Implement a simple EventEmitter class.","answer_vi":"EventEmitter quản lý named event subscriptions — implements Observer pattern.\n\n```js\nclass EventEmitter {\n  constructor() { this.events = {}; }\n  on(event, fn) { (this.events[event] ||= []).push(fn); }\n  off(event, fn) { this.events[event] = this.events[event]?.filter(f => f !== fn); }\n  emit(event, ...args) { this.events[event]?.forEach(fn => fn(...args)); }\n}\n```\n\nDùng trong state management, pub/sub systems.","answer_en":"EventEmitter manages named event subscriptions — an implementation of the Observer pattern.\n\n```js\nclass EventEmitter {\n  constructor() { this.events = {}; }\n  on(event, fn) { (this.events[event] ||= []).push(fn); }\n  off(event, fn) { this.events[event] = this.events[event]?.filter(f => f !== fn); }\n  emit(event, ...args) { this.events[event]?.forEach(fn => fn(...args)); }\n}\n```\n\nUsed in state management and pub/sub systems.","answer_html_vi":"<p>EventEmitter quản lý named event subscriptions — implements Observer pattern.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class EventEmitter {\n  constructor() { this.events = {}; }\n  on(event, fn) { (this.events[event] ||= []).push(fn); }\n  off(event, fn) { this.events[event] = this.events[event]?.filter(f =&gt; f !== fn); }\n  emit(event, ...args) { this.events[event]?.forEach(fn =&gt; fn(...args)); }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">EventEmitter</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span> = {}; }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, fn</span>) { (<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event] ||= []).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">push</span>(fn); }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">off</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, fn</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event] = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event]?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">filter</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">f</span> =&gt;</span> f !== fn); }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">emit</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, ...args</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event]?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">fn</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(...args)); }\n}</code></pre></div><p>Dùng trong state management, pub/sub systems.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>EventEmitter manages named event subscriptions — an implementation of the Observer pattern.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class EventEmitter {\n  constructor() { this.events = {}; }\n  on(event, fn) { (this.events[event] ||= []).push(fn); }\n  off(event, fn) { this.events[event] = this.events[event]?.filter(f =&gt; f !== fn); }\n  emit(event, ...args) { this.events[event]?.forEach(fn =&gt; fn(...args)); }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">EventEmitter</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span> = {}; }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, fn</span>) { (<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event] ||= []).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">push</span>(fn); }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">off</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, fn</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event] = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event]?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">filter</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">f</span> =&gt;</span> f !== fn); }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">emit</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, ...args</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">events</span>[event]?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">fn</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(...args)); }\n}</code></pre></div><p>Used in state management and pub/sub systems.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}